Ep, we're taking care of this many details because i'd like this to be
a familiar and regular world where each stary can be consistent in its
representation of how the station works. I'm planning on creating more
media for this world as time passes. I'd like it if adults could watch
the kids show, then graduate to more young-adult oriented material
that has the same setting, and in these media we'll explain this
stuff. In the kids show we won't really explain it, that'll just be
how it works. I appreciate the concern, and encourage you to continue
offering constructive criticism.

